/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 84 0 R
/T (MPLS or internet VPN for 3 branch clinics? I choose MPLS \(L3 VPN\) with an internet IPsec VPN as backup. Video consultations and patient records need predictable delay, jitter and loss, and MPLS gives an SLA and DiffServ classes. A pure internet VPN is cheaper but best-effort. The cheap VPN as a backup keeps clinics online if the MPLS circuit fails.)
