595 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 85 0 R
/T (Physical separation is worth it when the risk or rules demand it: regulated or highly sensitive zones \(patient data, payment systems, medical device networks\), a very high number of untrusted guests whose load must not touch the office, or when a separate ISP line is needed. For this admin block a VLAN with an ACL is enough.)
/E (Physical separation is worth it when the risk or rules demand it: regulated or highly sensitive zones \(patient data, payment systems, medical device networks\), a very high number of untrusted guests whose load must not touch the office, or when a separate ISP line is needed. For this admin block a VLAN with an ACL is enough.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [51]
>>
endobj
596 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 85 0 R
/T (The deny line blocks every internal 192.168.x.x subnet \(Office, CCTV and the router's own addresses\). The final permit lets guests reach everything else, i.e. the internet \(NAT on the outside interface\). A layer-3 switch \(SVIs + ip routing + the same ACL on interface vlan 30\) gives the same result at wire speed.)
/E (The deny line blocks every internal 192.168.x.x subnet \(Office, CCTV and the router's own addresses\). The final permit lets guests reach everything else, i.e. the internet \(NAT on the outside interface\). A layer-3 switch \(SVIs + ip routing + the same ACL on interface vlan 30\) gives the same result at wire speed.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [52]
>>
endobj
