1482 0 obj
<<
/Title (Why switched full-duplex Ethernet doesn't need CSMA/CD: each link joins just two devices with separate transmit and receive pairs, so nothing else can transmit on it and collisions are impossible. Why Wi-Fi still needs CSMA/CA: the radio channel is shared and half-duplex; a station can't listen while sending \(its own signal swamps its receiver\) and hidden terminals can't hear each other, so Wi-Fi avoids collisions with random backoff, ACKs and optional RTS/CTS.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1436 0 R
/Prev 1527 0 R
>>
endobj
